sequenceDiagram
    participant React UI
    participant API Gateway
    participant Auth Service
    participant Database

    React UI->>API Gateway: POST /api/v1/auth/login {email, password}
    API Gateway->>Auth Service: Route Request
    Auth Service->>Database: Query UserCredential by email
    Database-->>Auth Service: Return UserCredential
    Auth Service->>Auth Service: Compare BCrypt Password Hash
    alt Password Matches
        Auth Service->>Auth Service: Generate JWT Token (Claims: role, region, id)
        Auth Service-->>API Gateway: 200 OK {token, user_details}
        API Gateway-->>React UI: 200 OK {token}
    else Password Invalid
        Auth Service-->>API Gateway: 401 Unauthorized
        API Gateway-->>React UI: 401 Unauthorized
    end
